OL,4,BPSG's Doue to have surgery on ruptured 
OL,5,BACL                                    
OL,6,GParis St-Germain forward Desire Doue   
OL,7,Gwill have surgery later this month     
OL,8,Gafter rupturing the anterior cruciate  
OL,9,Gligament in his right knee.            
OL,11,FThe 21-year-old was in tears as he was 
OL,12,Ftaken off on a stretcher towards the   
OL,13,Fend of the first half in the Ligue 1   
OL,14,Fchampions' 3-2 victory over Nice on    
OL,15,FSaturday night.                        
OL,17,FDoue, who has arguably been PSG's best 
OL,18,Fplayer this season, twisted awkwardly  
OL,19,Fand went down under no contact.        
